      "text": "gospel to be made known to other nations that possess land, D&C 10:49. one man should not possess that which is above another, D&C 49:20. he who is ordained and sent forth is possessor of all things, D&C 50:27. no man is possessor of all things unless he is purified, D&C 50:28. rising generations that grow up on land of Zion shall possess it, D&C 69:8. bodies who are of celestial kingdom may possess earth forever, D&C 88:20 (103:7). in patience ye may possess your own souls, D&C 101:38. wheat may be secured to possess eternal life, D&C 101:65. ye shall possess the goodly land, D&C 103:20. Peter, James, and John possess keys of kingdom, D&C 128:20.",
